===Etymology===
{{etyl|NL.|en}} from the genus {{m|mul|Tilapia}}. A [[latinization]] of the {{etyl|tn|en}} word {{m|tn|tlhapi||fish}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|/təˈlɑːpiə/|lang=en}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/tɪˈlɑːpiə/|/tɪˈlæpiə/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɑːpiə|æpiə|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|tilapia}}

# Any of various [[edible]] [[fish]], of the [[genus]] ''[[Tilapia]]'', native to [[Africa]] and the [[Middle East]] but naturalized [[worldwide]].
#* '''2006''', {{w|Tom Waits}} and {{w|Kathleen Brennan}}, “Bottom of the World”:
#*: Well I dined last night with Scarface Ron
#*: On '''tilapia''' fishcakes and fried black swan.

